  - id: n_ticket_intro
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_menu
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Tanaka
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_1
    textJa: "この店は、先に券売機で、券を買います。メニューは、これです。"
    textReading: "このみせは、さきにけんばいきで、けんをかいます。メニューは、これです。"
    textEn: "Quán này phải mua vé ở máy bán vé trước. Thực đơn đây này."
    textRomaji: "Kono mise wa, saki ni kenbaiki de, ken wo kaimasu. Menyuu wa, kore desu."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: point
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_menu
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_flavor
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: 
    speakerId: 
    textJa: "券売機のボタン：しょうゆ 八百円　みそ 九百円　しお 八百円　ぎょうざ 四百円　大盛り 百円"
    textReading: "けんばいきのボタン：しょうゆ はっぴゃくえん　みそ きゅうひゃくえん　しお はっぴゃくえん　ぎょうざ よんひゃくえん　おおもり ひゃくえん"
    textEn: "Các nút của máy: shoyu 800 yên, miso 900 yên, shio 800 yên, gyoza 400 yên, thêm mì (oomori) 100 yên."
    textRomaji: "Kenbaiki no botan: shouyu happyaku en, miso kyuuhyaku en, shio happyaku en, gyouza yonhyaku en, oomori hyaku en"
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: n_flavor
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Tanaka
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_1
    textJa: "どのラーメンにしますか。私は、しょうゆです。"
    textReading: "どのラーメンにしますか。わたしは、しょうゆです。"
    textEn: "Bạn chọn ramen nào? Tôi chọn vị shoyu."
    textRomaji: "Dono raamen ni shimasu ka. Watashi wa, shouyu desu."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "みそラーメンにします。"
      textEn: "Cháu chọn ramen miso ạ."
      nextNodeId: n_pay_miso
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "Chọn món bằng mẫu 〜にします"
      grammarTags:
